  expr_cpp_err_new_primitive.pcpp - break step of expr_cpp.pcpp:
  new of a PaskalCPP type (PR0027)

  How to check, from repo\bin:
    pcpp res\tests\expr_cpp_err_new_primitive.pcpp
    pcpp res\tests\expr_cpp_err_new_primitive.pcpp -t x86_64-linux-gnu
